\newlabel{fig:coverage}{{4}{5}{Left: Density-weighted coverage percentage across time steps, with the 90\% target shown as a dashed red line. Right: Total router displacement (metres) per time step, showing sharply decreasing movement as the system stabilizes.\relax }{figure.caption.4}{}}
